# The ruling: the ability counts any spells cast this turn, Zenith itself included. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Zenith as its
# first spell (it is not on the battlefield then, so nothing triggers) and Mox Ruby as the second: Zenith is on the
# battlefield by now and triggers, counting its own cast. A third spell, Mox Sapphire, is a negative control.

